                                "sense_id": "eee73fba-4f3d-30c6-a969-d893f76f9328",
                                "text": "2007, Bill Mason, Connetquot targeted: BLACK POWDER HISTORY, Newsday.com, 14 July,\nPotassium nitrate, sulphur and charcoal are combined in proportions and through methods easily obtainable in books and on the Internet."
